{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":247311,\"title\":\"The Personals\",\"tagline\":\"Discover a new way to fall in love.\",\"overview\":\"A touching yet humorous tale of a divorced man searching for love in the personals column and finding out about life in the process.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xrs9rZABZfNJjn5duTeOlZaabzA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2tMIxSk7ue4fElUe4IpoknNuoNF.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":5,\"year\":1982,\"runtime\":92,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Peter Markle\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":67632,\"name\":\"Peter Markle\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/66qMUgwB04vBiludG0Hi8yF35We.jpg\"},{\"id\":975188,\"name\":\"Bill Schoppert\",\"character\":\"Bill\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4fLdqoIeyLoOEidCP2n1Tcwq4sP.jpg\"},{\"id\":159085,\"name\":\"Karen Landry\",\"character\":\"Adrienne\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":86006,\"name\":\"Paul Eiding\",\"character\":\"Paul\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3Gxs9fTnkQLFlmMHROlgiDJ4p10.jpg\"},{\"id\":19454,\"name\":\"Michael Laskin\",\"character\":\"David\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fSofPsl8VSnzNtb4Zaiv7KxotkS.jpg\"},{\"id\":4593564,\"name\":\"Victoria Dakil\",\"character\":\"Shelly\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4593565,\"name\":\"Chris Forth\",\"character\":\"Jennifer\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":75325,\"name\":\"Patrick Thomas O'Brien\",\"character\":\"Jay\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qeICm4FZ8biLtLCHn9D4XU7IgMY.jpg\"},{\"id\":4593573,\"name\":\"Claudia Bloch\",\"character\":\"Marriage counsellor\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":4593575,\"name\":\"Steve Cannon\",\"character\":\"Radio announcer (voice)\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":11648,\"title\":\"Must Love Dogs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/252PdRj3y2S05DC4oSf2qk2vva3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mZ5YlqaT0gZqXRoDkuMJfqB5OAI.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sarah Nolan is a newly divorced woman cautiously rediscovering romance with the enthusiastic but often misguided help of her well-meaning family. As she braves a series of hilarious disastrous mismatches and first dates, Sarah begins to trust her own instincts again and learns that, no matter what, it's never a good idea to give up on love.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13120,\"title\":\"In Search of a Midnight Kiss\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8CXdyfDOrYo9rQAL21OfSlOKVpC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jgafbeBhXtgsF96XndihesQ2UG9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Broke and alone on New Year's Eve, Wilson just wants to spend the rest of a very bad year in bed. But, when his best friend convinces him to post a personal ad, he meets a woman bent on finding the right guy to be with at midnight.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1081328,\"title\":\"Atrapadas en familia\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7nMRcShUYbVuOi2MItjqfhnSEKF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fxHw5g2lJxSFrqxi10KahA5BVKl.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Caro and Sofía get ready for a weekend with their families and the surprise of a marriage proposal that could go very wrong.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1548,\"title\":\"Ghost World\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uwKqnUPE4dSM0kKuMW0vXpURh2T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6zIOO1NrTehQkDaNfvga4luSRQc.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two quirky and cynical teenage girls try to figure out what to do with their lives following high school graduation. After they play a prank on an eccentric, middle-aged record collector, one of them befriends him, which causes a rift in the girls’ friendship.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1081316,\"title\":\"Prism\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bX8r4BzVexBrCeyx4waBr1635kA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A beautiful and lonely story of growth about high school students who dreamed of being ballet dancers at a young age, finding the meaning of life through each other, suffering and badly hurting each other.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1081313,\"title\":\"Tonight You're Sleeping with Me\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sexnKxpAOl0wfixYC3RataZD4pI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tpu9ILyknA4oE3vYUfPK7C4Aztw.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Stuck in a passionless marriage, a journalist must choose between her distant but loving husband and a younger ex-boyfriend who has reentered her life\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":77583,\"title\":\"Long-Term Relationship\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/v1UGXPuA1gMef8ofhYTFIr2XL7D.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7UUnH4RFGQy8Fr4OTcA9JrVedQy.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Tired of the unsatisfying singles scene, Glenn answers a personal ad and meets Adam, a handsome Southern man seeking a long-term relationship. The two hit it off immediately, but their initial attraction is soon put to the test. Glenn's gay friends say he'd be happier playing the field again, but his straight pals encourage him to work at the budding relationship.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":61192,\"title\":\"Personals: College Girl Seeking...\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eY9yF7SgETbk3FpE8ehk9VjKHAI.